    <bpmn:task id="Bridge_1_4603" name="**Transition sentence:**&#10;&#10;&#34;Once a refund is approved and processed in the customer complaint resolution process, the case transitions to subrogation procedures where the organization investigates whether the insurant can be held financially responsible for the reimbursement.&#34;&#10;&#10;This sentence clearly connects the outcome of Process A (approved refund) to the trigger for Process B (subrogation investigation), showing how the financial resolution of customer complaints initiates the insurance recovery process." />
